### Create payment
POST http://localhost:8082/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "merchant_id": "019faacc-976e-7692-b22f-364780c024cc",
    "card_token": "XXXXXX",
    "card_last4": "1234",
    "card_brand": "visa",
    "amount_cents": 100
 }

